    node_type: 'event',
    object_keys: [
      'normal:xitong',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '10个小时的高铁加2个小时的大巴……\n终于是回来了。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '累死 ${term.player.self_proud}了。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '这些年过去了，${county.name_full}县还是老样子，一点没变。\n老旧的矮楼，破烂的街道……',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '接下来，我做些什么呢？',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '叮……',
          speaker_key: 'normal:xitong',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '刚才我脑袋里的那是什么声音？',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '恭喜宿主，你的系统还有3秒抵达……',
          speaker_key: 'normal:xitong',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '3……2……1\n系统绑定成功。',
          speaker_key: 'normal:xitong',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '统子哥？！！',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '竟然是统子哥！！\n那本大爷岂不是起飞了！',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '统子哥，快介绍一下你的功能！',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '本统的功能很简单。\n就是以${county.name_full}县常驻人口为基数，每天百倍为宿主发放资金。\n每天发放时间: 0点\n当前本县常驻人口数：${county.renkou}\n今日应发放金额：${player.day_give_money}',
          speaker_key: 'normal:xitong',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
        {
          content: '由于今天是系统第一次激活，特给予宿主新手礼包：\n奖励翻倍！！！\n今日发放金额：${player.first_day_give_money}',
          speaker_key: 'normal:xitong',
          speaker_type: 'object',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '回到县城',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'default',
  },
  {
    end_script: '',
    id: '1st_give_money',
