    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'default',
  },
  {
    end_script: '// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“高调撒钱”招聘口径，形成后续助理对玩家的第一层预判，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线。\n// 计算规则：高调路线会提升招聘关注度，也更容易让应聘者先入为主地觉得玩家像暴发户老板，因此 first_impression 先写为 -1。\n// 写回变量：style=1，attention 增加，first_impression 设为偏负面但可被后续聊天修正；阶段保持为已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 2\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = -1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\ndoing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup")\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1',
    id: 'recruit_post_style_high',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    next: [],
    node_type: 'event',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '“高薪急招助理，效率第一，待遇不设上限，能立刻到岗最好。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '这话一发出去，像是在招人，也像是在告诉全县——${term.player.self_proud}有钱，而且很急着把摊子铺开。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '招聘口径：高调撒钱',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    end_script: '// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“务实正规”招聘口径，让助理后续更容易把玩家视为靠谱雇主，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 作为当前关注度基线。\n// 计算规则：务实路线关注度适中，能给应聘者较稳定、较专业的第一感受，因此 first_impression 先写为 1。\n// 写回变量：style=2，attention 小幅增加，first_impression 设为偏正面，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 2\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 1\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\ndoing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup")\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1',
    id: 'recruit_post_style_regular',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    next: [],
    node_type: 'event',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '“招聘助理一名，负责日程、对接、资料整理与事务跟进。薪资面议，流程规范，能长期配合优先。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '这份文案不花哨，但看起来像真准备做事。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '招聘口径：务实正规',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    end_script: '// 规则目的：记录玩家采用“低调试水”招聘口径，保留谨慎起步的团队搭建风格，并把应聘反馈延后到次日出现。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_attention} 当前关注度基线。\n// 计算规则：低调路线外界关注度最低，但也会让优秀应聘者怀疑岗位稳定性，因此 first_impression 先写为 0，表示中性偏观望。\n// 写回变量：style=3，attention 不增加，first_impression 设为中性；阶段保持已发布，并标记已发布招聘；应聘消息改为次日触发，同时开放后续查看入口。\n${player.team_recruit_style} = 3\n${player.team_recruit_attention} = ${player.team_recruit_attention} + 0\n${player.team_zhuli_first_impression} = 0\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_posted} = true\ndoing_unlock("do_recruit_zhuli_followup")\ninvoke_once pool recruit_zhuli_application delay_days=1',
    id: 'recruit_post_style_lowkey',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    next: [],
    node_type: 'event',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '“短期招聘一位事务协助，工作弹性，先合作看看，合适再长期安排。”',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
          content: '这种写法很稳，不容易招来太多闲话，但也容易让人觉得你还没想明白要做什么。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
      ],
      type: 'dialogue',
    },
    title: '招聘口径：低调试水',
    trigger_expr: '',
    trigger_mode: 'invoke',
  },
  {
    end_script: '// 规则目的：玩家选择立刻沟通，体现效率导向，并调度初聊节点。\n// 读取变量：${player.team_recruit_stage} 用于确认流程已进入收到应聘阶段。\n// 计算规则：response_style 约定为 1立刻沟通、2先看履历、3暂缓处理。立刻沟通会让助理觉得玩家执行快。\n// 写回变量：写入 response_style=1，并直接调度初聊事件。\n${player.team_recruit_response_style} = 1\n${player.team_recruit_stage} = Math.max(${player.team_recruit_stage}, 2)\ninvoke_once chain recruit_zhuli_first_chat',
    id: 'recruit_zhuli_reply_now',
    init_script: '',
    invoke_params: [],
    location: 'job_agency_linh',
    next: [],
    node_type: 'event',
    object_keys: [
      'player',
    ],
    presentation: {
      dialogues: [
        {
          content: '你没多想，直接点开对话框。',
          speaker_key: 'player',
          speaker_type: 'player',
        },
        {
